version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-10
repository-code: "https://github.com/snow-ghost/lrx-lean"
url: "https://github.com/snow-ghost/lrx-lean"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of the exact Cayley diameter of S_n with generators
  L, a cyclic shift, R = L inverse, and X, the transposition of the first two
  positions. For every n >= 4, the diameter is n*(n-1)/2. Includes upper and
  lower bounds, finite certificates checked by the Lean kernel, and an
  axiom audit of all project theorems.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - formal proof
  - Cayley graphs
  - symmetric group
  - diameter
  - A186783
